  "instance_name": "workweek_cultural_tropes",
  "label": "Workweek cultural tropes",
  "description": "A set of shared cultural references and humorous expressions that describe the negative feelings associated with the start of a workweek, especially Monday. These include phrases like 'Monday blues,' 'hump day,' or 'the Monday morning dread' meme, which are part of workplace humor and social media discourse. The meme relies on this collective understanding to resonate with its audience.",
